<title>USA: RehabCare to buy back up to 925,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>RehabCare to buy back up to 925,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>RehabCare Group Inc said it will repurchase up to 925,000 shares of its common stock, representing about 19.65 percent of its outstanding shares in a Dutch Auction tender offer.</p>
<p>The tender price will range from $20 to $22.50 per share, said the healthcare staffing services company.</p>
<p>The offer commenced on Friday and will expire February 28, unless extended, it said.  On January 28, RehabCare had 4,707,598 shares outstanding. &quot;The company will use available cash on hand and borrowings under its senior credit facility to purchase the shares,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
